cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the chapter below."
type: software
title: "eca-cnn-classification: convolutional neural networks for automated classification of elementary cellular automata"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the book chapter "Convolutional Neural Networks
  for Automated Cellular Automaton Classification": seeded generation of the
  64 x 64 ECA datasets, the rule-table scan, the exact hand-weighted CNN, the
  default and trimmed CNNs with online data augmentation, the figures, and a
  verification suite. The two bugs of the original notebooks can be reproduced
  (faithful mode) or fixed (corrected mode).
